@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 60

class "CommandRegistry\n(内核)" as Registry
interface Command <<内核>> {
  name
  usage
  execute(args, context)
}

class DirCommand <<Client>> {
  name = "dir"
  execute(args, context)
}

interface DirectoryLister <<Target>> {
  list(path) : DirectoryEntry[]
}

class NodeFsDirectoryAdapter <<Adapter>> {
  list(path) : DirectoryEntry[]
}

class "node:fs\nreaddirSync(path, {withFileTypes})" as Fs <<Adaptee>>

class DirectoryEntry {
  name
  kind : directory | file
}

Registry o--> Command
Command <|.. DirCommand
DirCommand --> DirectoryLister : 只依赖 Target
DirectoryLister <|.. NodeFsDirectoryAdapter
NodeFsDirectoryAdapter --> Fs : 转发并转换 Dirent → DirectoryEntry
DirectoryLister ..> DirectoryEntry

class FakeLister <<测试替身>>
DirectoryLister <|.. FakeLister

note bottom of DirCommand
  Client 还持有“当前目录提供者”
  （生产 = process.cwd，测试 = 固定值）。
  排序 / 标记 / 空目录 / 错误文案在这里，
  Adapter 只负责“读目录”。
end note
@enduml
